[
  {
    "RowId": 42109,
    "Text": "I am the soldier S0, of Alexandria's castle-guard. By order of the royal knights, I shall dispatch all intruders."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42110,
    "Text": "Releasing limiters... Initiating mobile combat maneuvers."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42111,
    "Text": "Calling reinforcements. Together we shall triumph."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42112,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42113,
    "Text": "Combat functions...inoperable... Forgive my failure..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42114,
    "Text": "Clear the foundation sector"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42115,
    "Text": "Defeat the gargant"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42116,
    "Text": "Clear the royal radius"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42117,
    "Text": "Defeat the soldier S0"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42118,
    "Text": "Clear the retrolevel"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42119,
    "Text": "Defeat the Valia Pira"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42120,
    "Text": "There are beasts ahead of you. They must have gotten in and made themselves at home."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42121,
    "Text": "The direct route is inaccessible. You'll have to go around."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42122,
    "Text": "There should be an access hatch nearby that leads inside. Look for an opening."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42123,
    "Text": "I'm detecting something big... You'll have to deal with it to continue on."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42124,
    "Text": "Good work. Now, proceed to the access hatch and head inside."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42125,
    "Text": "Everkeep's construction was apparently a constant battle against the rising water level."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42126,
    "Text": "Even during the war, the people labored to maintain the castle. It meant a lot to them."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42127,
    "Text": "It's upsetting to think that Preservation's terminal is in this place..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42128,
    "Text": "Hold on... Someone's jam...mmunications! Stay alert!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42129,
    "Text": "So you have come. Let us measure your strength."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42130,
    "Text": "That was hardly a challenge, I see."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42131,
    "Text": "You will show me more. I bid you press on."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42132,
    "Text": "You are untroubled thus far, but I have something that may test you yet."
  },
