  {
    "RowId": 42200,
    "Text": "What inspiration will you give me, I wonder!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42201,
    "Text": "Welcome to Sugar Riot's gallery of glamours!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42202,
    "Text": "Perhaps I'll draw...this!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42203,
    "Text": "And with a flourish, Sugar Riot brings her work to life!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42204,
    "Text": "When you can't decide on one thing..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42205,
    "Text": "An image comes to me! I hope you like it hot and sandy!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42206,
    "Text": "Goodness, the ring has become a desert!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42207,
    "Text": "How about a little more sunshine?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42208,
    "Text": "When I think desert, I think of these prickly fellows!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42209,
    "Text": "Watch out, it's a veritable storm of needles!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42210,
    "Text": "There's something missing... Oh, I know!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42211,
    "Text": "Quicksand!? You don't want to get caught in that!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42212,
    "Text": "Oh no! The challenger's been sucked in!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42213,
    "Text": "What do you say to a refreshing riverscape?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42214,
    "Text": "A crystal-clear river! How charming!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42215,
    "Text": "This is no good! It needs a touch of thunder, a dash of downpour!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42216,
    "Text": "A thunderstorm has turned the waters muddy! How frightening!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42217,
    "Text": "I have it! Some destruction to facilitate deconstruction!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42218,
    "Text": "A massive, raging storm! I hope you brought your parasols!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42219,
    "Text": "You've sparked my imagination! The ideas fairly erupt!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42220,
    "Text": "Lava is ravaging the ring! Talk about destructive creativity!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42221,
    "Text": "Pudding alone gets awfully dull, don't you think?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42222,
    "Text": "A transformative piece! The fiend has been completely remade!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42223,
    "Text": "What's your favorite color?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42224,
    "Text": "What do you think of this?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42225,
    "Text": "Needs more impact!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42226,
    "Text": "You've reminded me of something truly important: art must be free!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42227,
    "Text": "Defeat Sugar Riot"
  },
