  {
    "RowId": 42600,
    "Text": "Loath as I am to employ medicines in the application of harm, I <i>will</i> protect my patients."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42601,
    "Text": "Activate dispensers!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42602,
    "Text": "A potent concoction, this one.\n...I am sorry, but you must be stopped."
  },
